      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a lock-less check with `smp_load_acquire(\u0026page-\u003epage_ptr)` below in `get_page_range()`. This iterates over the \"inclusive\" range of pages that the buffer will use (including pages shared with other buffers). This will determine what pages are missing and need to be allocated/inserted into the vma by calling `binder_get_user_page_remote()`.\n\nHowever, since these pages are shared we may race with other requests and this is where the `mmap_write_lock()` helps to serialize these requests.\n\nI should probably explain this along with the release/acquire pair further in detail.",
      "parentUuid": "c614ec1e_0cb5ccdb",
